: \"Is it far from here?\" — Trả lời: \"No, you can walk.\" (Không, bạn có thể đi bộ.)","lessonId":"u10n6l4","lessonVersion":"v2.u10n6l4","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u10n6","order":77,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u10n6l4","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec2","signature":"DU9pwwIY7FSScU_quYR-NNwHTl38XM2_7NSl8CbbonUDnUu3EotTG9KZ45VneP4zKp7EBCmg-Vxhq2xqt8z9Cw","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["speaking","u10.grammar","u10.dialogue","u10.vocab"],"title":"Tôi bị lạc! · Bài 4","unitId":"u10"}